Autonomous Healthcare Intelligence</p></div><div class='body'><p class='greeting'>Welcome, {{$json.body.name}}! \ud83d\udc4b</p><p class='text'>Your <strong>Dignova AI</strong> account has been created. You're now part of the future of healthcare \u2014 where AI meets compassion.</p><div class='info-box'><p class='label'>YOUR ROLE</p><p><span class='badge badge-green'>Patient</span></p></div><p class='text'>To activate your account and start using Dignova AI, please verify your email address:</p><div style='text-align:center'><a href='{{$json.body.verify_url}}' class='btn'>\u2705 Verify My Email</a></div><hr class='divider'><p class='text' style='font-size:13px;'>\ud83e\udd16 <strong>What can you do?</strong><br>Chat with our AI triage assistant 24/7 \u2022 Get instant prescriptions for minor issues \u2022 Connect with doctors in seconds \u2022 Track your health over time.</p><p class='text' style='font-size:12px;color:#475569;'>This link expires in 1 hour. If you didn't create this account, ignore this email.</p></div><div class='footer'><p>\u00a9 2026 Dignova AI &nbsp;\u2022&nbsp; <a href='https://dignova.ai'>dignova.ai</a> &nbsp;\u2022&nbsp; Emergency: 1800-DIGNOVA</p></div></div></body></html>",
